{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55854","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 十一 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得圣超凡不作声，卧龙长怖（斯二一六五卷作「布」）碧潭清。\n人生若得长（斯卷作「常」）如此，大地那能留一名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}